{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的人物心理因果和段落之间的衔接不如Y清楚，部分感受意象也有堆叠、重复的倾向。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更适合边听边扫：短句和【】加亮让每段核心一眼可见，感受文字较小且部分随音乐进程出现，不必一次处理全部信息；它对声部、音型、力度变化和情绪转折的描写也更细致具体。Y的优势是人物心理解释得更充分，前因后果和情绪递进更连贯，但左侧长句更需要连续阅读，音乐感受的细节也相对概括。综合作为音乐视频的实时屏幕呈现，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "369cfe30-a77f-412f-9ad4-9cbc59a13e4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T200836514973Z", "elapsed_seconds": 233.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:12:30.010354+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4cfec078f6ec68fc3379fe5e296a90279640e45c2f0d3cfaadbf4eb1d098d387", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025